[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0651","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0651.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0887","title":"ISC BIND 8.2.2 ZXFR 请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 8.2 至 8.2.2-P6 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的压缩区域传输（ZXFR）请求并在未缓存的授权记录上执行名称服务查询触发漏洞，导致 BIND 进程崩溃或DNS服务中断。该漏洞影响范围涵盖使用受影响版本BIND的各种组织，可能导致网络服务中断。攻击者无需身份验证即可通过网络连接发起攻击，通过特定的请求模式利用BIND软件的查询处理机制中的资源耗尽或逻辑错误，触发系统资源耗尽或内存损坏，导致服务完全不可用。虽然该漏洞不影响保密性和完整性，但可用性影响程度达到部分影响（CVSS 评分 5.0）。Microsoft 及其他BIND相关厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，用户应及时升级到支持版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0887"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:40.657","remediation":"立即升级ISC BIND至8.2.3-P1或更高版本（如9.x稳定版），获取ISC官方安全补丁修复ZXFR漏洞。修改named.conf配置添加allow-transfer限制区域传输权限，配置allow-query限制查询来源，重启named服务生效。如无法立即升级，配置防火墙限制UDP/TCP 53端口仅允许信任网络访问，部署DNS缓存服务器预缓存权威记录以绕过ZXFR请求，监控named进程异常重启并配置自动重启机制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0217.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0657.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000338","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000339","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2000:067","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-20.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001112","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-107.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/143843","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1923","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5540","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20388","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0887.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0887","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0887.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0887.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aa53db02d27e1533ead482d079a27925c7448f01/2000/CVE-2000-0887.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0887.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0887.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1e95eda078cc027662ac8a3d9af8be2d7132ec73/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0887.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0887.json","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/2000/CVE-2000-0887.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0651.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0650","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0650.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0886","title":"微软 IIS 4.0/5.0 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 存在可执行文件解析漏洞（即\"Web 服务器文件请求解析\"漏洞），远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过发送针对可执行文件的畸形请求，在文件名后追加操作系统命令，导致服务器解析并执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 4.0 和 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于高危漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，通过构造包含系统命令的可执行文件请求路径，利用 IIS 对文件名解析不当的缺陷实现远程代码执行，可完全控制受影响的 Web 服务器。Microsoft 已于 2000 年 12 月发布安全公告 MS00-086 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0886"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:40.523","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-086 提供的补丁 (KB277873)，下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/bulletin/MS00-086.mspx。若使用 IIS 4.0，请升级至 IIS 5.0 并应用补丁；若使用 IIS 5.0，请直接安装补丁 KB277873。无法立即打补丁时，可在 IIS 管理器中移除不必要的脚本映射（如 .exe、.dll、.bat、.cmd 等可执行扩展名的映射），或在 IIS 中禁用脚本/可执行权限作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至 IIS 5.1 或更高版本（Windows XP/Server 2003 自带 IIS 5.1/6.0 已修复此漏洞）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1912","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?mid=143604&list=1&fromthread=0&end=2000-11-11&threads=0&start=2000-11-05&","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-086","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5470","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A191","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20384","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0886.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0886.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0886","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0886.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0886.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms00-086.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8x76-gx9r-885w/GHSA-8x76-gx9r-885w.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0886.yaml","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/d238d5bce44b90604ce028c0619c664802195051/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/scs/uclinux/blob/eb0cf9617bd22b69ad625575a95cf4fa2c140d55/user/snort/std-rules/web-iis.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0650.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0649","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0649.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0884","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 和 PWS Unicode 编码目录遍历漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 和 5.0 存在 Unicode 目录遍历漏洞，攻击者通过向服务器发送包含 Unicode 编码字符的恶意 URL 时，IIS 系统无法正确验证和处理路径，导致攻击者能够绕过 Web 根目录限制，读取服务器上其他目录的文件，甚至可能执行任意命令对服务器进行控制。该漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 和 PWS，允许远程未认证攻击者访问服务器的敏感文件系统，对 Web 应用安全造成严重威胁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0884"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:40.277","remediation":"立即升级到Windows Server 2003或更新版本（IIS 6.0或更高），这些版本提供了对Unicode目录遍历攻击的完整防护。如果无法立即升级，请立即联系微软技术支持获取安全补丁，同时在配置中禁用URL中Unicode编码的处理，并在web.config中添加安全规则以限制目录遍历访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/436","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1806","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-078","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5377","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A44","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/190","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0884.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0884.json","https://github.com/swiftlang/swift/blob/e8b2e3c3e776300459f6bdb291cb186039d33be9/stdlib/public/core/UTF8EncodingError.swift","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0884","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-0884.rules","https://github.com/OWASP/www-community/blob/a121184d999718e6e89020d0aea4ec5d5aa99f94/pages/attacks/Unicode_Encoding.md","https://github.com/trailofbits/cb-multios/blob/810d7b24b1f62f56ef49b148fe155b0d0629cad2/challenges/UTF-late/README.md","https://github.com/pinchbench/skill/blob/819384ae830492365b8363fc26bc2602e73f216d/tasks/task_log_apache_critical.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0884.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/989.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0649.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1700","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1700.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0916","title":"Linux内核2.2 TCP初始序列号可预测漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Linux内核2.2版本的TCP初始序列号（ISN）生成算法使用可预测的随机数机制，远程攻击者可通过分析返回值规律预测后续连接的初始序列号。该漏洞影响运行Linux内核2.2.x系列的操作系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可在远程发起利用，通过预测的ISN值伪造TCP数据包源地址或劫持已建立的合法TCP会话，实现会话劫持、数据包注入等攻击，严重威胁网络通信安全性与数据完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0916"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19","updated":"2000-12-19","remediation":"升级到 FreeBSD 4.1.1-STABLE 或 3.5.1-STABLE（修正日期 2000-09-28 之后）。若无法升级，下载官方补丁 ftp://ftp.freebsd.org/pub/FreeBSD/CERT/patches/SA-00:52/tcp-iss.patch，验证 PGP 签名后应用到 /usr/src/sys/netinet/tcp_seq.h 和 tcp_subr.c，将 random() 替换为 arc4random()，然后按 http://www.freebsd.org/handbook/kernelconfig.html 重新编译内核并重启。同时禁用基于 IP 地址的信任认证（如 .rhosts、hosts.equiv），改用 Kerberos 或密码认证的网络服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5b3647aa8630e92d52def237a668e1c7c212a696/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0916.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0916","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/035716a784b26bf707cbf0b8f17696c9c2e71cb8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0916.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/48bcd43923f8bb2f197ede4a17570cc3bd71fd9e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0916.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-4h9w-7r8x-ppq7/GHSA-4h9w-7r8x-ppq7.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0916.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2013/gb_nmap_tcp_seq.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1766/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0916.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1700.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0711","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0711.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0979","title":"XFree86 Xlib Display 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"XFree86 3.3.x 版本的 Xlib 库中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 DISPLAY 环境变量或在命令行中传递特制的 -display 参数，导致缓冲区溢出。成功利用此漏洞的攻击者可获取目标系统的 root 权限，执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 XFree86 3.3.5 及 3.3.6 版本，需本地访问权限进行利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0979","CVE-2000-0976"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19","updated":"2000-10-12","remediation":"升级至 XFree86 4.0 及以上版本，已修复 xlib 对 DISPLAY 变量的缓冲区边界检查缺陷。对于仍使用 3.3.x 的系统，可应用 SGI 安全公告 20020502-01-I 中的补丁程序。因 XFree86 已停止维护，建议迁移至 X.Org Server 作为替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0211.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5751.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1805","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20294"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20294"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0711.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0710","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0710.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0975","title":"Anaconda Foundation Directory apexec.pl 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Anaconda Foundation Directory 1.4 至 1.9 版本的 apexec.pl 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标发送包含 `../` 序列的特制 URL 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上任意文件（如 `/etc/passwd` 等敏感文件）。该漏洞利用难度低，无需认证即可触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0975"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Anaconda Foundation Directory 至 1.9 或更高版本，该版本修复了 apexec.pl 未正确过滤 ../ 路径遍历序列的问题。如无法立即升级，建议在 Web 服务器层面限制对 apexec.pl 的访问，或直接删除该 CGI 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0210.html","http://www.osvdb.org/435","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5750","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20611"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0710.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0940","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0940.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1212","title":"Zope Zope 2.2 DTML编辑权限提升漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.0至2.2.4版本中对Image和File对象的数据更新方法保护不充分，拥有DTML编辑权限的攻击者可利用该缺陷修改这些对象的原始数据，导致数据完整性受损。该漏洞影响Zope 2.2.x系列版本，攻击者需具备DTML编辑权限方可利用，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中等。建议升级至2.2.5及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1212"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-12-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23.580","remediation":"升级 Zope 至 2.2.5 或更高版本（官方 Hotfix_2000-12-18 已集成于该版本）。Debian 用户执行 `apt-get upgrade zope` 安装 DSA-007 安全更新；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000:135 提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，应严格限制 DTML 编辑权限仅授予可信用户，并移除 Image 和 File 对象的非必要数据更新方法访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000365","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2000:086","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-007","http://www.osvdb.org/6283","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-135.html","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2000-12-18/security_alert","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5778","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1212.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1212","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/zope/CVE-2000-1212.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1212.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/GHSA/data/2000/CVE-2000-1212.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/cba1106e73e57152f6afbb7764cd551d404f7b74/vulns/zope/PYSEC-2026-756.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/github-reviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7whr-j8vf-r4wj/GHSA-7whr-j8vf-r4wj.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/zope_img_updating.nasl","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/1xxx/cve-2000-1212.yaml","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0940.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0939","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0939.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1211","title":"Zope Zope 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.0至2.2.4版本中存在安全绕过漏洞，由于对DTML方法对象等旧式对象构造器名称的安全注册处理不当，导致攻击者可通过构造特制的请求绕过权限检查，执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响Zope Web应用服务器，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至2.2.5及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1211"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-12-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23.463","remediation":"升级 Zope 至 2.2.5 及以上版本，或安装 Zope 官方发布的 Hotfix_2000-12-08 安全补丁。Red Hat Linux 用户可安装 RHSA-2000-125 提供的更新包，Mandrake Linux 用户可安装 MDKSA-2000-083 提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，建议限制对 Zope 管理接口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5824.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2000/MDKSA-2000-083.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/6282","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-125.html","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2000-12-08/security_alert","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1211.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1211","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/zope/CVE-2000-1211.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1211.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/GHSA/data/2000/CVE-2000-1211.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/cba1106e73e57152f6afbb7764cd551d404f7b74/vulns/zope/PYSEC-2026-759.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7c78b01f402841eaeb570a26d276cd67a60a9531/advisories/github-reviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h2xh-jvpf-xq42/GHSA-h2xh-jvpf-xq42.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/1xxx/cve-2000-1211.yaml","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2483c534-9545-4934-b7ea-3251695e0ee0.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0939.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0921","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0921.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1045","title":"nss_ldap 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"nss_ldap 版本 121 之前在与 nscd（名称服务缓存守护进程）配合使用时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送大量 LDAP 请求，导致 nscd 服务资源耗尽或崩溃，从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要远程网络访问能力，但无需身份认证即可触发。nss_ldap 是 Linux/Unix 系统中用于通过 LDAP 目录服务解析用户和组信息的模块，广泛应用于企业级身份认证场景。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1045"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:02.470","remediation":"升级 nss_ldap 至 121 或更高版本，该版本已修复处理大量 LDAP 请求时的崩溃问题。如无法升级，可停止 nscd 服务（`service nscd stop && chkconfig nscd off`）或限制 LDAP 查询速率作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-066-1.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-024.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1863","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5449","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1045","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1045.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vhhj-4rwq-4chw/GHSA-vhhj-4rwq-4chw.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--06d9ace6-dcc3-4361-abf7-100bf4d66e4e.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1045.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv","https://github.com/JackRobert94464/RL-Honeypot/blob/f3b5fce36c605cae51854ec9770537fdb7114f05/Development/TPG-Data/htpg_mini.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0921.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0919","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0919.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1040","title":"SuSE Linux ypbind 日志记录格式化字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ypbind 3.3 的日志记录函数存在格式化字符串漏洞，当以调试模式运行时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 ypbind 服务发送特制的格式化字符串，导致文件描述符泄露，进而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 6.2/6.3/6.4/7.0 等版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至最新版本或禁用调试模式以缓解风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1040"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01.743","remediation":"升级 ypbind 至 3.3 以上已修复版本。各发行版对应操作：Red Hat Linux 升级至 RHSA-2000:086 提供的更新包；Debian GNU/Linux 安装 2000-10-14 发布的 ypbind 安全更新；SuSE Linux 6.2-7.0 用户安装 SuSE 安全公告 2000-Q4-0262 提供的修补包；Mandrake Linux 安装 MDKSA-2000:064 更新。如无法升级，在 ypbind 启动参数中去掉 -debug 标志以禁用调试模式，并在防火墙上限制对 ypbind 端口（默认 32768/65511 UDP）的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0356.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0429.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0262.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-039.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001014","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-064.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-086.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1820","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5394","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1040","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1040.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-phf2-3r4c-ww53/GHSA-phf2-3r4c-ww53.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-064.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ef876c58-f32f-43ce-901d-738a77565bed.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1040.json","https://github.com/l/debian-webwml/blob/80cd9461d384c50e61f7c585e566ce9d00c113fc/webwml/english/security/2000/20001014.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0919.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0776","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0776.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1078","title":"Mirabilis ICQ Web Front Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mirabilis ICQ Web Front HTTPd 存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送包含 \"?\" 字符的特制 URL 请求，导致 Web Front 服务进程崩溃，引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ICQ 0.99、98.0a、2000.0A、99a 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前厂商已停止维护该产品，建议用户迁移至替代方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1078"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06.287","remediation":"将 ICQ Web Front HTTPd 升级至官方修复版本（如 2000b 及以上），或禁用 Web Front 组件。如无法升级，在防火墙或反向代理层面过滤包含 \"?\" 的畸形请求，并限制对 ICQ HTTPd 服务端口的访问仅限可信 IP 段。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的即时通讯解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/138332","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5332","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20071","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4603507d019be3585b2e7bcddcb6c6f57901b490/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1078","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1078.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xh54-hh7j-wm53/GHSA-xh54-hh7j-wm53.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/icq_crash.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1078.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/yonggui-li/CVE-2020-4464-and-CVE-2020-4450/blob/fd2d621b14b665a596066f11f76f640122edfdab/main.go"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0776.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0775","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0775.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1075","title":"Netscape Directory Server 4.12 目录遍历漏洞","description":"iPlanet 证书管理系统 4.2 及目录服务器 4.12 存在目录遍历漏洞。由于服务对用户输入的路径缺乏充分过滤，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Agent、End Entity 或 Administrator 服务发送含有 `../` 的恶意请求，利用目录遍历技术突破路径限制，读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1075"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05.947","remediation":"建议升级到 Oracle Directory Server Enterprise Edition 11gR1 (11.1.1.7.0) 或更高版本，该版本已修复路径遍历问题。如无法升级，应在反向代理或 WAF 侧过滤 ../ 等路径遍历序列，并限制 Agent、End Entity、Administrator 服务的访问来源 IP 至可信管理网段。长期方案建议迁移至当前仍受支持的 LDAP 目录服务器（如 389 Directory Server）以获取持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0383.html","http://www.iplanet.com/downloads/patches/0122.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4086","http://www.osvdb.org/486","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1839","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5421","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20325","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4603507d019be3585b2e7bcddcb6c6f57901b490/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1075","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1075.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w468-9c9j-8x8w/GHSA-w468-9c9j-8x8w.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/iplanet_dir_serv.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/iplanet_traversal.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1075.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--33e8d795-a735-46dd-840b-f4678aa155f1.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0775.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0773","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0773.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1074","title":"Netscape iCal 2.1 csstart 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"iCal 2.1 Patch 2 中的 csstart 程序使用相对路径安装 libsocket 和 libnsl 库，本地攻击者可利用 icsuser 账户在当前或父目录放置特洛伊木马库，从而在程序执行时加载恶意库实现本地权限提升，获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Netscape iPlanet iCal 2.1 Patch 2 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1074"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05.833","remediation":"将 csstart 脚本中 libsocket 和 libnsl 的加载路径改为绝对路径（如 /usr/lib/libsocket.so），避免从当前目录或父目录加载。同时，在脚本执行前通过 export PATH 移除路径中的 . 和 ./，阻止相对路径劫持。最有效的方案是升级到 iCal 2.1 Patch 3 或更高版本，官方已修复该问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a100900-1.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/7209","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1769","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5757","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20276","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4603507d019be3585b2e7bcddcb6c6f57901b490/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1074.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1074","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35