0 的 pollit.cgi 管理认证模块存在设计缺陷，远程攻击者无需知道真实管理员密码，只需将 HTTP 请求参数 entered_password 和 admin_password 设置为相同值即可绕过身份验证，获取管理后台的完全访问权限，进而可对投票数据进行未授权操作。该漏洞影响 Poll It 2.01 及更早版本，CVSS 评分为 6.4，危害等级中高危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1069"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:05.270","remediation":"将 pollit.cgi 中 ReadForm() 调用移至脚本最前（第 15 行之前），确保所有内部变量声明都在 ReadForm 之后执行，防止攻击者通过 CGI 参数覆盖 $admin_password 等关键变量。同时限制 CGI 目录的 Web 访问权限，在 .htaccess 中添加 Allow/Deny 规则仅允许可信 IP 访问管理功能，并将 pollit_files/ 目录的敏感文件（如 ips.txt）配置为不可被 Web 直接访问。鉴于 cgi-world.com 已停止维护该脚本，强烈建议迁移至其他仍在更新的安全投票系统（如 LimeSurvey 或 PollDaddy）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236719315352&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5419","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/177","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4603507d019be3585b2e7bcddcb6c6f57901b490/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1069","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1069.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9g9j-gh9g-48x5/GHSA-9g9j-gh9g-48x5.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88551/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1069.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba